      "created_at": "2015-01-25T08:04:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi All,</p><p>Each of Omnitron's components say:</p><blockquote><p>Destroy this card when Omniton is dealt 7 or more damage in one round.</p></blockquote><p>I ran into a situation where I had taken out Omnitron without dealing him 7 damage in that round.&nbsp; Omnitron was \"gone\", but some of his drones/devices were still in play so the game was still going.&nbsp; I technically can't deal Omnitron any more damage, but techincally he can't deal me any damage with the components (as the cards all say Omnitron deals damage).&nbsp; I assume they are usless cards.&nbsp; Or does Omnitron's ghost stike back from the dead?</p><p>Thanks</p><p>Ben</p>",
