      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-25T17:18:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yup.&nbsp; With the coming of WCos, there are now *lots* of situations where a card can end up just \"sitting\" somewhere without haing much effect.&nbsp; Sky Scraper's Links, Captain Cosmic's Constructs, and Guise's Lemme See That can all have their targets leave play, but *they* stay where they are until something specifically effects *them*.</p>",
